# Ignore everything at root
/*
/*/

# Allowlist top-level code / config / infra
!*.R
!*.stan
!*.py
!*.sh
!Makefile

# Allowlist the scripts/ helpers subdir
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# Allowlist the exact fit-time input and sanitized environment record needed to
# verify that later metadata corrections did not alter modeled values.
!provenance/
!provenance/chordal_fit_2026-07-28/
!provenance/chordal_fit_2026-07-28/**

# Allowlist SLURM submission scripts
!slurm/
!slurm/*.sh
!.gitignore
!README.md
!NUMBERS.md
!LICENSE
!CITATION.cff
!config.yaml
!Dockerfile
!.github/
!.github/**

# Allowlist canonical input dataset.
# Within input_data/, only global_data_c29.csv is tracked. The four
# environmental rasters (C4 NUS NetCDF + OIPC δ²H + GMTED elevation)
# are ~308 MB total and cannot be hosted in git directly; the README
# documents how to obtain them.
!input_data/
input_data/**
!input_data/global_data_c29.csv
!input_data/calibration_curation_v1.csv
!input_data/leafwax_d2h_c29_calibration_v1.csv
!input_data/leafwax_d2h_c29_calibration_v1.sha256
!input_data/leafwax_d2h_c29_calibration_v1_dictionary.md
!input_data/leafwax_d2h_c29_calibration_v1_exclusions.csv

# NOTE on what is intentionally NOT tracked:
#   data/compilation/   — compilation building scripts and intermediate
#                          CSVs. The shipped product is input_data/, so
#                          the build-the-input chain is local-only.
#   data/HrenBrandon/   — compilation source spreadsheets (likewise).
#   archive/            — historical / superseded compilation lineages.
#   manuscript/         — narrative docs, drafts, figure_code,
#                          table_code, generated figures and tables.
#                          The repo is for replicating analysis numbers
#                          from input_data/ via the top-level R/Python
#                          pipeline; the manuscript is delivered
#                          separately.
# These directories fall through the leading "/*" / "/*/" ignore. Do
# NOT add allowlist lines for them.

# Within tracked subtrees, still exclude junk
**/.DS_Store
**/.Rhistory
**/.RData
**/.claude/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.bak
**/*.bak_*
**/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Root-level working files to keep out
check_all_knots.R
results/
model_analysis/
.gstack/
